      {
        "author_name": "Ranbir Saini",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115689661516210926549/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLzzQ7xTHyxBe-3RK1Aw6fGT2GG9dmM-4WHuusrKdbt-tN1bA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I recently had a fantastic experience with Taxi Prime that really stood out. The driver was not only punctual but also incredibly friendly, making the ride feel more like a pleasant conversation than just a trip from point A to point B. The car was clean and comfortable, which added to the overall positive experience.",
        "time": 1740263819,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "connie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110577547281767157318/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzwzVF-GvZlB8Cvk-fW9EAAdi39RgLmT5GeXLiiU88nwzSZCyQ1A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Do not use this service if you need to be picked up at the airport. I booked a taxi the day before flying home arriving at 11:30pm. Received a text message when I landed that was sent at 10pm  saying sorry take a cab from the airport we dont have anyone to drive you. They had 24hr+ to tell me that. Horrible service.\n\nUpdated comment per their reply : I had taken this service with a friend who had booked it to get to the airport 2 weeks prior. I asked if they pick up at airports as well. the driver said yes and told me to just leave note with details of the flight info when booking. Attached is the form in the app that prompts you to provide those details when you select airport location. Also attached is a pic of the two text messages i received confirming the pick up and a second cancelling within the  hour of landing saying they don’t have any drivers nearby.    If u don’t offer airport service you sure don’t let anyone know!",
        "time": 1739191437,
        "translated": false
      }
